# Owners of the files that decide how later changes are reviewed: the
# vendored rules, the vendored gate tooling with its manifest
# (pr-reviewer/VENDOR_MANIFEST.yaml), the workflow that loads them, and the
# other files the pull-request guard freezes. GitHub and GitLab both read a
# CODEOWNERS file at the repository root, so this one file serves both.
#
# This file names owners; it does not enforce them. Require code-owner review
# in branch protection or a ruleset, with no bypass. In your own copy, name a
# team that has write access to your repository.
/.reviewer.yaml                @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
/pr-reviewer/                  @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
/.github/                      @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
/threat-model/boundaries.yaml  @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
.gitattributes                 @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
/CODEOWNERS                    @aws-samples/sample-agentic-cicd
